供し、農泊推進\n及び交流人口の増加を図\n\nことが望ましい\n\nる。\n\n指標⑤\n330\n\nが多かったなどで寄附額が\n\nに、新規返礼品の充実に\n\n61\n\n指標②\n\n指標① お試し住宅利用日数（1箇所当たり）（年間）\n\n今後の方針の理由\n\n2,353\n\n新しいひとの流れを創る）\n\n「“ほどヨイ！田舎”来てみんちゃ","page":null,"sheet":null,"cell":"extracted-text:chars:6890-7459"},{"sourceUrl":"https://www.town.shoo.lg.jp/uploaded/attachment/1114.pdf","sourcePageUrl":"https://www.town.shoo.lg.jp/uploaded/attachment/1114.pdf","format":"pdf","fetchedAt":"2026-10-23T19:21:19.378Z","sha256":"c6281deeb82e36372fae3704db8d526e0e572adb9c32474511df17e861bfeb29","rawText":"「“ほどヨイ！田舎”来てみんちゃ","page":null,"sheet":null,"cell":"extracted-text:chars:7443-7459"},{"sourceUrl":"https://www.town.shoo.lg.jp/uploaded/attachment/1114.pdf","sourcePageUrl":"https://www.town.shoo.lg.jp/uploaded/attachment/1114.pdf","format":"pdf","fetchedAt":"2026-10-23T19:21:19.378Z","sha256":"c6281deeb82e36372fae3704db8d526e0e572adb9c32474511df17e861bfeb29","rawText":"い♪勝央体験」事業","page":null,"sheet":null,"cell":"extracted-text:chars:6890-6899"},{"sourceUrl":"https://www.town.shoo.lg.jp/uploaded/attachment/1114.pdf","sourcePageUrl":"https://www.town.shoo.lg.jp/uploaded/attachment/1114.pdf","format":"pdf","fetchedAt":"2026-10-23T19:21:19.378Z","sha256":"c6281deeb82e36372fae3704db8d526e0e572adb9c32474511df17e861bfeb29","rawText":"令和5年度\n①\n\n勝央町元気なまち総合戦略 事業実施評価調書","page":null,"sheet":null,"cell":"extracted-text:chars:0-30"}],"extractionStatus":"partial","warnings":["保存済み抽出テキストから部分構造化。PDF原本との再照合は未実施。表の空欄・列位置を推測して補完していません。原典ページ番号は未復元のため抽出テキスト内の文字位置を記録。","総合戦略の個別評価No.16の名称断片を同一原典内の固定offsetで照合。既存16行は変更しない。PDF列順の逆転部分は各断片を別々に引用し、KPI・金額・評価区分は未抽出。評価対象であることを示す候補であり全事業の実施完了を意味しない。"]},{"id":"cached-33622-d370074505d7be5b26765741","municipalityCode":"33622","municipalityName":"勝央町","projectCode":null,"projectName":"「“ほどヨイ！田舎”住んでみんちゃい」お試し住宅事業","department":null,"evaluationYear":null,"evaluatedFiscalYear":2023,"purpose":null,"activities":null,"outcomes":null,"amounts":[],"indicators":[],"ratings":[],"evidence":[{"sourceUrl":"https://www.town.shoo.lg.jp/uploa